{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9a00e46e-c0a5-476b-852a-1825d64d801b",
    "name": "Distributed Wagering Processor API (Jungle Gaming)",
    "description": "# 🦧 Distributed Wagering Processor API\n\nDocumentação interativa completa para desenvolvedores e equipe de QA com scripts de automação de fluxo de variáveis.\n\n## 💡 Automação de Variáveis entre Requisições\n- **1. Criar Carteira**: Ao executar a criação da carteira, a variável `walletId` é **capturada automaticamente** da resposta e salva no ambiente da coleção para usar nas chamadas seguintes.\n- **3. Submeter Aposta**: Salva automaticamente a `externalTransactionId` para uso em chamadas de estorno (`REFUND`).\n- **4. Replay Idempotente**: Executa asserção automática garantindo que `idempotentReplay === true`.\n- **7. Reconciliação**: Executa asserção automática garantindo que `consistent === true`.\n\n## ⚠️ Tabela de FailureCodes\n- `INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS`: Saldo insuficiente para débito.\n- `CURRENCY_MISMATCH`: Moeda divergente da carteira.\n- `DUPLICATE_TRANSACTION`: Mesma chave externa já registrada.\n- `REFERENCE_NOT_FOUND`: Transação de referência em REFUND/ROLLBACK não encontrada.\n- `IDEMPOTENCY_PAYLOAD_MISMATCH`: Mesma chave de idempotência usada com payload diferente (HTTP 409).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "walletId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "playerId",
      "value": "player-postman-777",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "lastBetExternalId",
      "value": "bet-1001",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Criar Carteira (Create Wallet)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 201 or 200', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
              "});",
              "",
              "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "if (jsonData.id) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('walletId', jsonData.id);",
              "    console.log('✅ Auto-captured walletId:', jsonData.id);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"playerId\": \"{{playerId}}\",\n  \"initialBalance\": {\n    \"amount\": \"1000.00\",\n    \"currency\": \"BRL\"\n  }\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wallets",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["wallets"]
        },
        "description": "Cria uma nova carteira para o jogador. O script captura automaticamente o `id` da carteira e preenche a variável `walletId` para as demais requisições."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Consultar Saldo da Carteira (Get Wallet)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('Wallet balance is present', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('balance');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["wallets", "{{walletId}}"]
        },
        "description": "Retorna o estado atual da carteira capturada automaticamente."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Submeter Aposta (Submit BET)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Transaction status is PROCESSED', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql('PROCESSED');",
              "});",
              "pm.test('idempotentReplay is false for first attempt', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.idempotentReplay).to.eql(false);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "postman:bet-1001" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"providerId\": \"postman\",\n  \"externalTransactionId\": \"{{lastBetExternalId}}\",\n  \"playerId\": \"{{playerId}}\",\n  \"walletId\": \"{{walletId}}\",\n  \"roundId\": \"round-42\",\n  \"gameId\": \"fortune-tiger\",\n  \"kind\": \"BET\",\n  \"money\": { \"amount\": \"25.00\", \"currency\": \"BRL\" }\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["wagering", "transactions"]
        },
        "description": "Debita R$ 25.00 da carteira e atualiza o saldo."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Testar Idempotência (Replay BET)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('idempotentReplay is TRUE on re-submission', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.idempotentReplay).to.eql(true);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "postman:bet-1001" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"providerId\": \"postman\",\n  \"externalTransactionId\": \"{{lastBetExternalId}}\",\n  \"playerId\": \"{{playerId}}\",\n  \"walletId\": \"{{walletId}}\",\n  \"roundId\": \"round-42\",\n  \"gameId\": \"fortune-tiger\",\n  \"kind\": \"BET\",\n  \"money\": { \"amount\": \"25.00\", \"currency\": \"BRL\" }\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["wagering", "transactions"]
        },
        "description": "Reenvia a aposta anterior com a mesma chave. Script de teste valida que `idempotentReplay === true`."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Submeter Ganho (Submit WIN)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Status is PROCESSED', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql('PROCESSED');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "postman:win-1002" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"providerId\": \"postman\",\n  \"externalTransactionId\": \"win-1002\",\n  \"playerId\": \"{{playerId}}\",\n  \"walletId\": \"{{walletId}}\",\n  \"roundId\": \"round-42\",\n  \"gameId\": \"fortune-tiger\",\n  \"kind\": \"WIN\",\n  \"money\": { \"amount\": \"50.00\", \"currency\": \"BRL\" }\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["wagering", "transactions"]
        },
        "description": "Credita R$ 50.00 de prêmio."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Submeter Estorno (Submit REFUND)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "postman:refund-1003" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"providerId\": \"postman\",\n  \"externalTransactionId\": \"refund-1003\",\n  \"referenceExternalTransactionId\": \"{{lastBetExternalId}}\",\n  \"playerId\": \"{{playerId}}\",\n  \"walletId\": \"{{walletId}}\",\n  \"roundId\": \"round-42\",\n  \"gameId\": \"fortune-tiger\",\n  \"kind\": \"REFUND\",\n  \"money\": { \"amount\": \"25.00\", \"currency\": \"BRL\" }\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["wagering", "transactions"]
        },
        "description": "Estorna a aposta anterior utilizando a `referenceExternalTransactionId` salva automaticamente."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Consultar Extrato (Get Ledger)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/ledger?limit=50",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["wallets", "{{walletId}}", "ledger"],
          "query": [{ "key": "limit", "value": "50" }]
        },
        "description": "Retorna os lançamentos de extrato."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Reconciliar Saldo (Reconcile Balance)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Financial reconciliation is CONSISTENT', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.consistent).to.eql(true);",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.difference.amount).to.eql('0.00');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/reconciliation",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["wallets", "{{walletId}}", "reconciliation"]
        },
        "description": "Executa auditoria do saldo. Test script asserta que `consistent === true`."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "9. Health Check Readiness",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health/ready",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["health", "ready"]
        },
        "description": "Verifica a saúde do serviço."
      }
    }
  ]
}
